8: /**
9:  * `extractVariableNames()` is a companion function for `evaluate()` and `evaluateAsync()` which extracts the
10:  * names of all unbound identifiers used in the expression. The idea is to be able to extract all of the names
11:  * of variables that will need to be supplied in order to correctly process the expression.
